-- חוזר לבעלויות תשס"ט/4 — הסכם קיבוצי עם ארגון המורים (5.1.2009) והסדר לתגמול עבודה עם תלמידים לקויי למידה (29.1.2009)
-- The 5.1.2009 agreement with the secondary teachers' organisation — the
-- reward for preparing classes for the cumulative matriculation exams in
-- mathematics and English (2% from 1.9.2008, weekly hours from 1.9.2009) and
-- the new telephone reimbursement — and the Treasury's arrangement rewarding
-- work with learning-disabled pupils in exams, in units of 0.5% of salary.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `הסכם קיבוצי 5.1.2009 והסדר תגמול לעבודה עם תלמידים לקויי למידה`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, title, date (29.1.2009), addressee, greeting and subject line; no rule.

-- Time in this file is counted in salary months from September 2008 (1):
-- January 2009 is 5, February 2009 is 6.
`January 2009`  MEANS 5
`February 2009` MEANS 6

§§ `1 הסכם קיבוצי מיום 5.1.2009`

-- akn:art_1 The heading: the collective agreement of 5.1.2009 with the teachers' organisation in secondary schools, seminaries and colleges.

-- akn:art_1__para_a §1א: the agreement was signed on 5.1.2009 by the Centre of Local Government and the three large cities with the secondary teachers' organisation and approved by the Treasury's wage commissioner; a recital, no rule.

-- §1ב: it applies to employees of the employers in secondary education on
-- the teaching grading who are represented by the teachers' organisation.
@ref akn:art_1__para_b akn:art_1__para_b/p2
GIVEN `in secondary education` IS A BOOLEAN, `on the teaching grading` IS A BOOLEAN, `represented by the organisation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 5.1.2009 agreement applies` `in secondary education` `on the teaching grading` `represented by the organisation` IF
    `in secondary education` AND `on the teaching grading` AND `represented by the organisation`

§§ `1ג גמול הכנה לבגרות`

DECLARE `cumulative subject` IS ONE OF `mathematics`, `English`

@desc One class a teacher prepares for one matriculation questionnaire, in the school year the class sits it.
DECLARE `prepared class` HAS
    `subject`                    IS A `cumulative subject`
    `school year beginning`      IS A NUMBER  @desc the calendar year the school year begins (2008 for 2008-09)
    `questionnaire serial`       IS A NUMBER  @desc the questionnaire's serial number in the cumulative method (1 to 7)
    `pupils in the class`        IS A NUMBER
    `full-position base`         IS A NUMBER  @desc the combined salary, תוספת '94, תוספת 2001 and תוספת 2008 for a FULL position at the teacher's grade and seniority, whatever the position fraction; an input

-- §1ג.1: from the dates below, the reward for preparing pupils for the
-- matriculation exams in mathematics and English in the cumulative method
-- (only) is computed as follows. (א): from 1.9.2008, for preparing one
-- class for one questionnaire, in the school year the class sits it, a
-- supplement of 2% of the combined salary, תוספת '94, תוספת 2001 and
-- תוספת 2008 for a full position at the teacher's grade and seniority,
-- whatever the position fraction.
@ref akn:art_1__para_c akn:art_1__para_c__subpara_1 akn:art_1__para_c__subpara_1__cls_a
GIVEN c IS A `prepared class`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2% supplement for one class and one questionnaire` c IS
    IF c's `school year beginning` AT LEAST 2008
    THEN `the matriculation rate` TIMES c's `full-position base`
    ELSE 0

`the matriculation rate` MEANS 2%

-- §1ג.1ב: in addition, from 1.9.2009, for preparing one class for one
-- questionnaire, in the school year the class sits it, weekly hours beyond
-- the actual position, by the questionnaire's serial number in the table,
-- whatever the position fraction.
@ref akn:art_1__para_c__subpara_1__cls_b
GIVEN c IS A `prepared class`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the additional weekly hours` c IS
    IF c's `school year beginning` AT LEAST 2009
    THEN sum (map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `weekly hours`)
                  (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `serial on the questionnaire` EQUALS c's `questionnaire serial`)
                          `the weekly-hours table`))
    ELSE 0

@desc A row of section 1ג.1ב's table.
DECLARE `questionnaire row` HAS
    `serial on the questionnaire` IS A NUMBER
    `weekly hours`               IS A NUMBER

-- The table: the questionnaire's serial number and its weekly hours.
@ref akn:art_1__para_c__subpara_1__cls_b/p2 akn:art_1__para_c__subpara_1__cls_b/p3 akn:art_1__para_c__subpara_1__cls_b/p4 akn:art_1__para_c__subpara_1__cls_b/p5 akn:art_1__para_c__subpara_1__cls_b/p6 akn:art_1__para_c__subpara_1__cls_b/p7 akn:art_1__para_c__subpara_1__cls_b/p8 akn:art_1__para_c__subpara_1__cls_b/p9
`the weekly-hours table` MEANS
    LIST `questionnaire row` 1 0.5,
         `questionnaire row` 2 0.5,
         `questionnaire row` 3 1,
         `questionnaire row` 4 1,
         `questionnaire row` 5 1,
         `questionnaire row` 6 1.25,
         `questionnaire row` 7 1.25

-- §1ג.2: the reward of sub-section (א) is paid for a class of at least 10
-- pupils; 6–9 pupils earn 50% of it and 1–5 pupils 25%. The reading
-- adopted (F-2008-09_tashsat_04-a): the reduction reaches the 2% of
-- "sub-section (א)" only, not §1ג.1ב's hours.
@ref akn:art_1__para_c__subpara_2 akn:art_1__para_c__subpara_2/p2
GIVEN c IS A `prepared class`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the matriculation supplement` c IS
    `the 2% supplement for one class and one questionnaire` c TIMES `the class-size share` (c's `pupils in the class`)

GIVEN pupils IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the class-size share` pupils IS
    BRANCH IF pupils AT LEAST 10 THEN 1
           IF pupils AT LEAST 6  THEN 50%
           IF pupils AT LEAST 1  THEN 25%
           OTHERWISE 0

-- The other reading of §1ג.2: the reduction reaches the hours too.
GIVEN c IS A `prepared class`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the additional weekly hours if §1ג.2 reaches them` c IS
    `the additional weekly hours` c TIMES `the class-size share` (c's `pupils in the class`)

-- §1ג.3: for the reward for preparing for the matriculation in mathematics
-- and English in the cumulative method, this section replaces every
-- existing provision on computing the reward; the reward's other
-- conditions, provisions and rules are not changed.
@ref akn:art_1__para_c__subpara_3
GIVEN c IS A `prepared class`
      `the reward's other conditions are met` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the other conditions, provisions and rules on the matriculation-preparation reward, which this section leaves as they are; an input
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the matriculation-preparation reward in the cumulative method` c `the reward's other conditions are met` IS
    IF `the reward's other conditions are met`
    THEN `the matriculation supplement` c
    ELSE 0

§§ `1ד החזר הוצאות טלפון`

-- §1דא: from 1.9.2008 a teaching employee is no longer entitled to
-- reimbursement for installing and keeping a telephone.
@ref akn:art_1__para_d akn:art_1__para_d__subpara_a
GIVEN `school year beginning` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `installation and upkeep are reimbursed in` `school year beginning` IF
    `school year beginning` LESS THAN 2008

-- §1דב: from 1.9.2008 every teaching employee is reimbursed for telephone
-- expenses by the Accountant-General's instructions for civil servants,
-- for group 8, as they are from time to time — 48.6 a month for group 8
-- in the attached circular.
@ref akn:art_1__para_d__subpara_b
GIVEN `school year beginning` IS A NUMBER,
      `group 8's monthly amount` IS A NUMBER @desc the Accountant-General's amount for group 8 as it is at the time
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the telephone reimbursement of every teaching employee` `school year beginning` `group 8's monthly amount` IS
    IF `school year beginning` AT LEAST 2008
    THEN `group 8's monthly amount`
    ELSE 0

`group 8's monthly amount when written` MEANS 48.6

-- §1דג: notwithstanding (ב), principals and deputy principals who on the
-- eve of the agreement were entitled, for upkeep and calls together, to
-- more than (ב) gives them are entitled to the higher of the two.
@ref akn:art_1__para_d__subpara_c
GIVEN `is a principal or deputy` IS A BOOLEAN,
      `previous monthly entitlement` IS A NUMBER @desc for upkeep and calls together, on the eve of the agreement
      `group 8's monthly amount` IS A NUMBER     @desc the Accountant-General's current amount for group 8
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the monthly telephone reimbursement` `is a principal or deputy` `previous monthly entitlement` `group 8's monthly amount` IS
    IF `is a principal or deputy`
    THEN max `previous monthly entitlement` `group 8's monthly amount`
    ELSE `group 8's monthly amount`

§§ `1ה ביצוע ותשלומים`

-- §1ה: the payments start with January 2009's salary and at the latest
-- February 2009's, and the differences from 1.9.2008 are paid with
-- January 2009's salary, at the latest February 2009's.
@ref akn:art_1__para_e akn:art_1__para_e/p2
GIVEN `owed with differences` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `agreement action`
DECIDE `the agreement is paid by February 2009` `owed with differences` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay under the agreement with differences from 1.9.2008` x
          PROVIDED x AT LEAST `owed with differences`
    WITHIN `February 2009`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 1ה: payments and differences from 1.9.2008 are made with January 2009's salary, at the latest February 2009's"

DECLARE `agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `pay under the agreement with differences from 1.9.2008` HAS `agreement amount` IS A NUMBER

§§ `2 הסדר לתגמול עבודה עם תלמידים לקויי למידה`

-- akn:art_2 akn:art_2/p1 The heading, and the recital that this is the arrangement in the wage commissioner's letter of 5.1.2009 to the Ministry's director-general, as agreed with the Ministry, the Centre of Local Government and the teachers' organisations.

DECLARE `accommodation` IS ONE OF
    `extra time in the exam, in the teacher's presence`
    `reading the questionnaire to the pupils`
    `an oral exam`
    `taking down the exam answers dictated by the pupil`
    `transcribing the pupil's exam answers`

@desc One accommodation a teacher carried out, as section 2א asks about it.
DECLARE `accommodation done` HAS
    `kind of accommodation`                    IS AN `accommodation`
    `pupils served`                            IS A NUMBER
    `done from 1.9.2008`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `beyond the hours of the position`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `in the upper or middle division`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `an exam as the Ministry's guidelines define it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc whether the occasion is an "exam" within the Ministry of Education's guidelines; an input
    `pupil defined learning-disabled under the Ministry's procedures` IS A BOOLEAN
    `accommodation approved by the competent body` IS A BOOLEAN
    `teacher entitled to the special-education reward` IS A BOOLEAN
    `teacher employed under Ofek Hadash`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `salary base`                              IS A NUMBER  @desc the combined salary, תוספת '94, תוספת 2001 and תוספת 2008; an input

-- §2א.1: from 1.9.2008, for the actions below done with learning-disabled
-- pupils in hours beyond those the position includes, the teaching
-- employees employed in the upper division or the middle division are paid
-- the reward ("התגמול").
@ref akn:art_2__para_a akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_1
GIVEN d IS AN `accommodation done`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the action is within the arrangement` d IF
        d's `done from 1.9.2008`
    AND d's `beyond the hours of the position`
    AND d's `in the upper or middle division`

-- §2א.1's table: the reward units of each kind of action, and the pupils it
-- may be done for — a single pupil, or a single pupil or a group.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_1/p3 akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_1/p4 akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_1/p5 akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_1/p6 akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_1/p7 akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_1/p8 akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_1/p9 akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_1/p10 akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_1/p11
GIVEN a IS AN `accommodation`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `reward units for` a IS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `extra time in the exam, in the teacher's presence` THEN 1
    WHEN `reading the questionnaire to the pupils` THEN 1
    WHEN `an oral exam` THEN 1
    WHEN `taking down the exam answers dictated by the pupil` THEN 1.25
    WHEN `transcribing the pupil's exam answers` THEN 1.25

GIVEN a IS AN `accommodation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be done for a group` a IF
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `extra time in the exam, in the teacher's presence` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `reading the questionnaire to the pupils` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

GIVEN d IS AN `accommodation done`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the pupils fit the table` d IF
    d's `pupils served` EQUALS 1 OR `may be done for a group` (d's `kind of accommodation`)

-- ¶12: a reward unit is 0.5% of a salary base of the teacher's combined
-- salary, תוספת '94, תוספת 2001 and תוספת 2008.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_1/p12
GIVEN d IS AN `accommodation done`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the value of a unit` d IS
    `the unit rate` TIMES d's `salary base`

`the unit rate` MEANS 0.5%

-- ¶13: "exam" is as the Ministry's guidelines on the matter define it.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_1/p13
GIVEN d IS AN `accommodation done`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `it is an exam` d IF
    d's `an exam as the Ministry's guidelines define it`

-- §2א.2: at the end of 2008-09 the reward for transcription is discussed
-- again; a change agreed applies only to the period after the day it is
-- agreed.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_2
GIVEN `day of the work` IS A NUMBER, `day the change was agreed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a changed transcription reward applies to work on` `day of the work` `day the change was agreed` IF
    `day of the work` GREATER THAN `day the change was agreed`

-- §2א.3: the reward is not in the base of percentage supplements and is
-- not salary for the hour value, severance, pensions, pension
-- contributions or the continuing-education fund.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_3
GIVEN p IS A `purpose the reward is left out of`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the reward is left out of` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `the base of percentage supplements` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the hour value` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `severance pay` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `pensions` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `pension contributions` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the continuing-education fund` THEN TRUE

DECLARE `purpose the reward is left out of` IS ONE OF
    `the base of percentage supplements`
    `the hour value`
    `severance pay`
    `pensions`
    `pension contributions`
    `the continuing-education fund`

-- §2א.4: on the reward a deposit is made to a provident fund for savings
-- (one not paying an annuity), under the agreement of 17.12.1998: 5%
-- employer and 5% employee.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_4
GIVEN reward IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `provident deposit`
DECIDE `the provident-fund deposit on the reward` reward IS
    `provident deposit` WITH
        `by the employer` IS 5% TIMES reward
        `by the employee` IS 5% TIMES reward

DECLARE `provident deposit` HAS
    `by the employer` IS A NUMBER
    `by the employee` IS A NUMBER

-- §2א.5: paid on the report that the actions were done, with the salary
-- for the month after the month they were done; the teacher's report needs
-- the approval of the principal of the school employing the teacher. Time
-- here: months from the month the work was done (0).
@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_5
GIVEN d IS AN `accommodation done`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reward action`
DECIDE `the reward is paid the month after` d IS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `approve the teacher's report`
    HENCE PARTY `the employer`
          MUST  `pay the reward` x
                PROVIDED x AT LEAST `the reward for` d
          WITHIN 1
          LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 2א.5: the reward is paid with the salary for the month after the work"

DECLARE `reward action` IS ONE OF
    `approve the teacher's report`
    `pay the reward` HAS `reward paid` IS A NUMBER
    `keep the record of accommodations` HAS `record` IS AN `accommodation record`
    `report the record as the Ministry will announce`
    `appoint a learning-disabilities coordinator instead of another`

-- §2א.6: the arrangement applies only to an action with a learning-disabled
-- pupil defined as such under all the Ministry's procedures, whose
-- accommodation requiring the action was approved under the Ministry's
-- rules by the competent bodies.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_6
GIVEN d IS AN `accommodation done`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the pupil and the accommodation qualify` d IF
        d's `pupil defined learning-disabled under the Ministry's procedures`
    AND d's `accommodation approved by the competent body`

-- §2א.7א, the Ministry's remarks: units are allotted like the trip-escort
-- reward, by a quota per class: 52 units a year for a standard class of
-- grades 7–9, 130 for a normative class of grades 10–12; in the upper
-- division allotted per pupil and passed to the owning bodies in the
-- payments system, explained in the payments circular for February 2009.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_7 akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_7__cls_a akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_7__cls_a/p2
GIVEN grade IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the yearly unit quota of a class in grade` grade IS
    BRANCH IF grade AT LEAST 10 AND grade AT MOST 12 THEN 130
           IF grade AT LEAST 7  AND grade AT MOST 9  THEN 52
           OTHERWISE 0

-- §2א.7ב: principals keep orderly track and a full record — the teacher's
-- name and identity number, the date and hour of the accommodation, the
-- pupils' full names and identity numbers, its subject and its kind — and
-- the schools will report them during the year in a way they will be told.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_7__cls_b akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_7__cls_b/p2 akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_7__cls_b/p3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reward action`
DECIDE `the principal keeps the record` IS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `keep the record of accommodations` r
          PROVIDED `the record is full` r
    HENCE PARTY `the school principal`
          MUST  `report the record as the Ministry will announce`

@desc One line of the principal's record.
DECLARE `accommodation record` HAS
    `teacher name and identity number`   IS A STRING
    `date and hour`                      IS A STRING
    `pupils' names and identity numbers` IS A LIST OF STRING
    `subject of the accommodation`       IS A STRING
    `kind recorded`                      IS AN `accommodation`

GIVEN r IS AN `accommodation record`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the record is full` r IF
        (NOT null (r's `pupils' names and identity numbers`))
    AND (NOT (r's `teacher name and identity number` EQUALS ""))
    AND (NOT (r's `date and hour` EQUALS ""))
    AND (NOT (r's `subject of the accommodation` EQUALS ""))

-- §2א.7ג: the school may appoint a learning-disabilities coordinator within
-- the roles and rewards it has under the takanon (section 1.12), in place of
-- another coordinator whose role earns a reward, as the principal decides
-- and subject to the role's requirements.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_7__cls_c akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_7__cls_c/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reward action`
DECIDE `a coordinator may be appointed` IS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MAY   `appoint a learning-disabilities coordinator instead of another`

-- §2א.7ד: the reward may be given only to teaching employees not entitled
-- to the special-education reward.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_7__cls_d
GIVEN d IS AN `accommodation done`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the teacher is not entitled to the special-education reward` d IF
    NOT d's `teacher entitled to the special-education reward`

-- §2ב: the arrangement in §2א applies to teaching employees not employed
-- under the conditions of the Ofek Hadash reform.
@ref akn:art_2__para_b
GIVEN d IS AN `accommodation done`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the teacher is not under Ofek Hadash` d IF
    NOT d's `teacher employed under Ofek Hadash`

§§ `The reward for one accommodation`

-- Sections 2א.1, 2א.6, 2א.7ד and 2ב together.
GIVEN d IS AN `accommodation done`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `earns the reward` d IF
        `the action is within the arrangement` d
    AND `it is an exam` d
    AND `the pupils fit the table` d
    AND `the pupil and the accommodation qualify` d
    AND `the teacher is not entitled to the special-education reward` d
    AND `the teacher is not under Ofek Hadash` d

-- The reading adopted (F-2008-09_tashsat_04-b): the units are earned once
-- per accommodation given in one exam, whatever its length.
@export The reward for one exam accommodation given to learning-disabled pupils under circular 2008-09/4
GIVEN d IS AN `accommodation done` @desc the accommodation, the pupils and the teacher
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reward for` d IS
    IF `earns the reward` d
    THEN `reward units for` (d's `kind of accommodation`) TIMES `the value of a unit` d
    ELSE 0

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off and signature, and the list of what is attached (the 5.1.2009 agreement and the arrangement), which the corpus does not carry; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- F-2008-09_tashsat_04-a: for a class of 8 pupils sitting questionnaire 6
-- in 2009-10, the hours are 1.25 or 0.625 a week by the reading of §1ג.2.
`eight pupils, questionnaire 6, 2009-10` MEANS
    `prepared class` WITH
        `subject`               IS `mathematics`
        `school year beginning` IS 2009
        `questionnaire serial`  IS 6
        `pupils in the class`   IS 8
        `full-position base`    IS 10000

`§1ג.2's reach changes the hours` MEANS
    NOT (`the additional weekly hours` `eight pupils, questionnaire 6, 2009-10`
         EQUALS `the additional weekly hours if §1ג.2 reaches them` `eight pupils, questionnaire 6, 2009-10`)
#ASSERT `§1ג.2's reach changes the hours`

-- F-2008-09_tashsat_04-b: an oral exam of three hours earns 1 unit per exam
-- or 3 per hour.
`a three-hour oral exam` MEANS
    `accommodation done` WITH
        `kind of accommodation`                    IS `an oral exam`
        `pupils served`                            IS 1
        `done from 1.9.2008`                       IS TRUE
        `beyond the hours of the position`         IS TRUE
        `in the upper or middle division`          IS TRUE
        `an exam as the Ministry's guidelines define it` IS TRUE
        `pupil defined learning-disabled under the Ministry's procedures` IS TRUE
        `accommodation approved by the competent body` IS TRUE
        `teacher entitled to the special-education reward` IS FALSE
        `teacher employed under Ofek Hadash`       IS FALSE
        `salary base`                              IS 10000

`units per exam and per hour differ` MEANS
    NOT (`the reward for` `a three-hour oral exam` EQUALS 3 TIMES `the reward for` `a three-hour oral exam`)
#ASSERT `units per exam and per hour differ`

-- Examples. The base of 10,000 is a placeholder.
-- 2% × 10,000 × 50% = 100; 1.25 hours from 1.9.2009.
#ASSERT `the matriculation supplement` `eight pupils, questionnaire 6, 2009-10` EQUALS 100
#ASSERT `the additional weekly hours` `eight pupils, questionnaire 6, 2009-10` EQUALS 1.25
#ASSERT `the class-size share` 5 EQUALS 25%
-- One unit = 0.5% × 10,000 = 50.
#ASSERT `the reward for` `a three-hour oral exam` EQUALS 50
#ASSERT `the monthly telephone reimbursement` TRUE 70 48.6 EQUALS 70
#ASSERT `the monthly telephone reimbursement` FALSE 70 48.6 EQUALS 48.6
#ASSERT `the yearly unit quota of a class in grade` 11 EQUALS 130
#ASSERT NOT `installation and upkeep are reimbursed in` 2008

#TRACE `the reward is paid the month after` `a three-hour oral exam` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the school principal` DOES `approve the teacher's report` AT 0
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the reward` 50 AT 1
#TRACE `the agreement is paid by February 2009` 1000 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay under the agreement with differences from 1.9.2008` 1000 AT 5
